{'symbol': 'AKAM', 'date': '2021-10-21 06:30:00', 'title': 'AKAMAI TECHNOLOGIES COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF GUARDICORE TO EXTEND ITS ZERO TRUST SOLUTIONS TO HELP STOP RANSOMWARE', 'text': "CAMBRIDGE, MASS., OCT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AKAMAI TECHNOLOGIES, INC. \xa0(NASDAQ: AKAM), THE WORLD'S MOST TRUSTED SOLUTION TO POWER AND PROTECT DIGITAL EXPERIENCES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY HAS COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF GUARDICORE OF TEL AVIV, ISRAEL."}